From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:46:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msado15: Recordset.Clone and friends, Fields enumeration,
 Connection.Errors and transactions (3004)

Recordset: Clone is a snapshot of the rows with a position of its own (it used
to hand back the same object), CompareBookmarks (bookmarks are row numbers),
Collect get and put through the fields, DataMember, MarshalOptions, StayInSync,
NextRecordset (there is never another one), ActiveConnection put and putref
(refused while open), and the field-level ActualSize (the size of the type for
fixed size fields, the length for text and binary), Status, Precision and
NumericScale.
Fields: _NewEnum is a real enumerator, Delete removes a field of a recordset
that is not open, Refresh and Resync have nothing to do, Update and
CancelUpdate act on the current record.
Connection: Errors is a collection that is the same object every time (always
empty: nothing reports provider errors yet), and BeginTrans, CommitTrans and
RollbackTrans go to the session's ITransactionLocal with the connection's
isolation level, or fail with adErrFeatureNotAvailable when it has none.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

